{
  "name": "wick-engine",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "This is the official implementation of the Wick Editor Core Engine. <what does it do>. It is built to be easily plugged into used by a GUI for creating and editing Wick projects (e.g. the Wick Editor) or a player for embedding and running Wick projects (e.g. the Wick Player).",
